sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Gateway as maas-default-gateway<br/>(openshift-ingress)<br/>HTTPRoute
    participant AuthPolicy as Kuadrant AuthPolicy<br/>API Key + TokenReview<br/>+ OIDC JWT (optional)
    participant MaaSAPI as maas-api<br/>:8443/TCP HTTPS<br/>:8080/TCP HTTP
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>:6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controllers as Manager Controllers<br/>(7 reconcilers)
    participant PostgreSQL as PostgreSQL DB<br/>(maas-db-config)
    participant OTEL as OpenTelemetry<br/>Collector (gRPC)

    Note over Client,Gateway: External API Surface

    Client->>Gateway: POST /v1/models, /v1/subscriptions,<br/>/v1/api-keys/*, /maas-api/*<br/>HTTPS/443
    Gateway->>AuthPolicy: Authenticate request
    AuthPolicy->>K8sAPI: TokenReview (validate bearer token)
    K8sAPI-->>AuthPolicy: Token valid/invalid
    AuthPolicy-->>Gateway: Auth result + policy decision
    Gateway->>MaaSAPI: Forward to backend<br/>port 8443 (URLRewrite: /maas-api/* -> /*)

    Note over MaaSAPI,K8sAPI: Internal API Surface

    MaaSAPI->>K8sAPI: SubjectAccessReview<br/>(admin authorization check)
    K8sAPI-->>MaaSAPI: Access decision

    MaaSAPI->>PostgreSQL: Query/mutate tenant data<br/>(maas-db-config secret)
    PostgreSQL-->>MaaSAPI: Query results

    MaaSAPI->>OTEL: Export traces<br/>OTLP/gRPC

    MaaSAPI-->>Gateway: JSON Response
    Gateway-->>Client: Response

    Note over Controllers,K8sAPI: Controller Reconciliation Loops

    K8sAPI->>Controllers: Watch events:<br/>AITenant, ExternalModel,<br/>MaaSAuthPolicy, MaaSModelRef,<br/>MaaSSubscription, MaasTenantConfig

    Controllers->>K8sAPI: CRUD: HTTPRoute, AuthPolicy,<br/>TokenRateLimitPolicy,<br/>Namespace, ConfigMap, Secret

    Note over Client,MaaSAPI: Internal-Only Endpoints

    MaaSAPI->>MaaSAPI: /v1/tenants (ClusterIP only)<br/>:8080/TCP HTTP (no Gateway exposure)

    Note over MaaSAPI: Health Probes (unauthenticated)
    MaaSAPI->>MaaSAPI: /health :8080 (liveness)<br/>/healthz :8081 (health)<br/>/readyz :8081 (readiness)
